Error [E1004]: `X25519SecretKey` has no `generate`
  --> tests/ui/retired_x25519_secret_key_generate.jet:5:35
    |
  5 |     key :: crypto.X25519SecretKey.generate()
    |                                   ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Constructors that draw entropy use `new_random`
 Fix: Use `X25519SecretKey.new_random()`
